            "text": "John Mills and Cecil Parker starred in the 1956 movie It's Great to Be Young which runs 94 minutes and had Gilbert Taylor as the cinematographer. The movie costed \u00a3282,838."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "\"It's Great to Be Young\", released in 1956, made 282,838 pounds at the box office. The film is 94 minutes long and stars Cecil Parker. John Mills also had a main role in the movie, and Gilbert Taylor did the cinematography."
        },
